{"seq":1,"slug":"feed-schema-field-mapping","title":"Feed Schema 建模与字段映射规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/feed-build-transform/feed-schema-field-mapping","wordCount":2893,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"feed-schema-建模与字段映射规则\">Feed Schema 建模与字段映射规则</h1><p>同一件棉质衬衫，在 Google Merchant Center 上要凑齐 <code>id</code>、<code>title</code>、<code>description</code>、<code>link</code>、<code>image_link</code>、<code>price</code>、<code>availability</code>、<code>condition</code> 八个必填字段；在 Meta 目录里可用性枚举写的是 <code>in stock</code> 而 Google 写的是 <code>in_stock</code>；到了 Amazon，字段集不由平台统一规定，而由该商品的 <code>productType</code> 对应的 JSON Schema 决定——同一件衬衫是 <code>SHIRT</code> 还是 <code>APPAREL</code> 会带来完全不同的必填属性。内部 PIM 只有一份商品主数据，却要投影到 N 份互不兼容的字段契约上。喂给渠道的每一个字段，本质上都是「内部属性 → 渠道字段」这条映射的一次求值；这篇文档拆解这条映射如何被建模成可校验、可回归、可版本化的规则集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-feed-契约的四层抽象\">核心概念：feed 契约的四层抽象</h2><p>multichannel feed 工程里最容易被混淆的，是把「渠道规范」「内部主数据」「映射规则」「序列化格式」当一件事。它们必须分开建模，因为变更节奏完全不同：渠道规范一年改几次（Meta 2024 年调整过 <code>availability</code> 的写法约定），内部主数据随商品生命周期天天改，映射规则随运营活动按周改，序列化格式几乎不变。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[内部主数据 PIM&lt;br/&gt;canonical attribute model] --&gt; B[映射规则集&lt;br/&gt;mapping rule set]&#10;  C[渠道 feed 规范&lt;br/&gt;channel schema spec] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D[中间表示 IR&lt;br/&gt;per-channel attribute map]&#10;  D --&gt; E{序列化}&#10;  E --&gt;|XML/RSS 2.0| F[Google Merchant feed]&#10;  E --&gt;|CSV/TSV| G[Meta catalog feed]&#10;  E --&gt;|JSON schema batch| H[Amazon PTD batch]&#10;  D --&gt; I[校验器&lt;br/&gt;validator]&#10;  C --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[错误报告&lt;br/&gt;逐行逐字段]\">graph TD\n  A[内部主数据 PIM&lt;br/&gt;canonical attribute model] --&gt; B[映射规则集&lt;br/&gt;mapping rule set]\n  C[渠道 feed 规范&lt;br/&gt;channel schema spec] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D[中间表示 IR&lt;br/&gt;per-channel attribute map]\n  D --&gt; E{序列化}\n  E --&gt;|XML/RSS 2.0| F[Google Merchant feed]\n  E --&gt;|CSV/TSV| G[Meta catalog feed]\n  E --&gt;|JSON schema batch| H[Amazon PTD batch]\n  D --&gt; I[校验器&lt;br/&gt;validator]\n  C --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[错误报告&lt;br/&gt;逐行逐字段]</pre><p>四层各自的职责与所有权：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>谁改</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渠道规范</td>\n<td>字段名、类型、枚举、长度上限、必填性</td>\n<td>平台方</td>\n<td>季度级</td>\n<td>全量 item 被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部主数据</td>\n<td>商品 ID、标题、类目、价格、库存、媒体</td>\n<td>商家/PIM</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>单 item 数据陈旧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射规则</td>\n<td>源字段到目标字段的变换函数</td>\n<td>运营/工程</td>\n<td>周级</td>\n<td>字段静默为空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>XML 转义、CSV 引号、编码</td>\n<td>工程</td>\n<td>年级</td>\n<td>解析失败，整批 rejected</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把映射规则单独抽出来，是为了让它可被单测：若映射逻辑散在「拼 XML 字符串」的代码里，一次渠道枚举变更就要改代码、发版、回归；抽成规则表则只是改一行数据。</p>\n<p>映射的完备性有一个可观测指标。设渠道 schema 的必填属性集为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{req}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，某 item 的实际填充集为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，则<strong>必填覆盖率</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{|F \\cap A_{\\text{req}}|}{|A_{\\text{req}}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时该 item 必然在渠道侧报错。工程上不应等渠道回执才发现，而应在映射求值后立刻算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 并直接拒发——渠道的拒绝回执要等几小时到几天，自己算这一秒就能得到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"google-merchant-center-字段契约的基线\">Google Merchant Center：字段契约的基线</h2><p>Google 的商品数据规范（Product Data Specification，<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112</a> ）是行业内最常被当作参照的一份契约，其必填/选填划分、长度约束和枚举定义被大量渠道模仿。核心约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>必填性</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>2026 年实践要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td>≤50 字符，同一 feed 内唯一</td>\n<td>用 SKU 而非商品名；变体必须各自唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>title</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td>≤150 字符</td>\n<td>超长会被截断而非拒绝，但截断会打掉关键词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>description</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td>≤5000 字符</td>\n<td>HTML 标签会被剥离，只剩文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>link</code> / <code>image_link</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td>落地页 URL；图片 ≥100×100 px</td>\n<td><code>link</code> 必须与图片站点同域；主图不能带水印</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>price</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td>数字 + ISO 4217 币种</td>\n<td>格式 <code>10.00 USD</code>，两位小数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>availability</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td><code>in_stock</code> / <code>out_of_stock</code> / <code>preorder</code> / <code>backorder</code></td>\n<td>下划线小写，与 Meta 不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>condition</code></td>\n<td>必填</td>\n<td><code>new</code> / <code>refurbished</code> / <code>used</code></td>\n<td>二手/翻新品写错会触发政策拒登</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gtin</code> / <code>mpn</code> / <code>brand</code></td>\n<td>条件必填</td>\n<td>由 <code>identifier_exists</code> 决定</td>\n<td>见下方标识符一节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>feed 文件本身用 RSS 2.0 承载，Google 的命名空间固定在 <code>http://base.google.com/ns/1.0</code>，所有商品属性都要带 <code>g:</code> 前缀：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;item&gt;&#10;  &lt;g:id&gt;SHIRT-BLK-M&lt;/g:id&gt;&#10;  &lt;g:title&gt;纯棉圆领短袖衬衫 黑色 M&lt;/g:title&gt;&#10;  &lt;g:availability&gt;in_stock&lt;/g:availability&gt;&#10;  &lt;g:price&gt;19.90 USD&lt;/g:price&gt;&#10;&lt;/item&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>SHIRT-BLK-M&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>纯棉圆领短袖衬衫 黑色 M&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:availability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>in_stock&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:availability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>19.90 USD&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">g:price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一 schema 还有 Content API for Shopping 这条写入通道（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content\">https://developers.google.com/shopping-content</a> ），可按 item 增量推送而不必整包重传。选文件还是 API 取决于更新频率：日更以下用文件，实时库存必须用 API——这是本章另一篇「增量与全量 feed 同步」要回答的问题，本篇只负责把字段填对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字段映射引擎-变换原语的表达\">字段映射引擎：变换原语的表达</h2><p>一个映射规则集由若干条规则组成，每条规则是 <code>(源路径, 变换原语, 目标字段, 参数)</code> 的四元组。真实项目里 95% 的需求落在少数几个原语上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原语</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>direct</code></td>\n<td>直接搬运</td>\n<td><code>sku → id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>static</code></td>\n<td>常量填充</td>\n<td><code>condition = &quot;new&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>value_map</code></td>\n<td>枚举翻译</td>\n<td><code>&quot;有货&quot; → in_stock</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lookup</code></td>\n<td>跨表查表</td>\n<td><code>category_code → google_product_category</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>concat</code></td>\n<td>拼接</td>\n<td><code>brand + &quot; &quot; + title</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>regex_extract</code></td>\n<td>正则抽取</td>\n<td>从标题抽容量 <code>\\d+\\s?(ml|L)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arithmetic</code></td>\n<td>数值计算</td>\n<td>含税价 = 未税价 × (1 + 税率)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>conditional</code></td>\n<td>条件分支</td>\n<td>若 <code>stock=0</code> 则 <code>availability=out_of_stock</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>default</code></td>\n<td>兜底值</td>\n<td>缺失品牌时填商家名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>执行顺序必须固定为 <strong>规范化 → 映射 → 派生 → 校验</strong> 四段，而不是让规则自由排序：派生字段依赖映射结果（<code>availability</code> 依赖已翻译的库存状态），校验必须看到最终值。顺序一旦可配置，同一份规则集在不同批次产生不同结果，回归测试就失去意义。</p>\n<p><code>value_map</code> 是最高频的出错点，因为它翻译枚举，而枚举恰恰是渠道间差异最大的地方：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[内部库存状态&lt;br/&gt;IN_STOCK / LOW / OUT / PREORDER] --&gt; M{value_map}&#10;  M --&gt;|IN_STOCK, LOW| G1[Google: in_stock]&#10;  M --&gt;|OUT| G2[Google: out_of_stock]&#10;  M --&gt;|PREORDER| G3[Google: preorder]&#10;  M --&gt;|IN_STOCK, LOW| F1[Meta: in stock]&#10;  M --&gt;|OUT| F2[Meta: out of stock]&#10;  M --&gt;|PREORDER| F3[Meta: preorder]\">flowchart TD\n  S[内部库存状态&lt;br/&gt;IN_STOCK / LOW / OUT / PREORDER] --&gt; M{value_map}\n  M --&gt;|IN_STOCK, LOW| G1[Google: in_stock]\n  M --&gt;|OUT| G2[Google: out_of_stock]\n  M --&gt;|PREORDER| G3[Google: preorder]\n  M --&gt;|IN_STOCK, LOW| F1[Meta: in stock]\n  M --&gt;|OUT| F2[Meta: out of stock]\n  M --&gt;|PREORDER| F3[Meta: preorder]</pre><p>注意 <code>LOW</code>（低库存）在两端都归到「有货」——这是业务决策而非技术决策，必须写进规则表并附注释，否则下一个人会以为漏了一个状态。每条 <code>value_map</code> 都应覆盖源枚举的<strong>全集</strong>，漏掉任何一支都意味着该状态静默产出空值或旧值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标识符策略-gtin-mpn-brand-与变体分组\">标识符策略：GTIN、MPN、brand 与变体分组</h2><p>商品标识符是 feed 里唯一会被平台用于<strong>跨商家去重与匹配</strong>的字段，填错的代价不是拒登，而是商品与错误的「同款」聚合，评价和比价都落到别人身上。Google 的三件套是 <code>gtin</code>（8/12/13/14 位）、<code>mpn</code>、<code>brand</code>，必填性由布尔属性 <code>identifier_exists</code> 控制：有正规 GTIN 的商品必须填并留空 <code>identifier_exists</code>（默认 <code>true</code>）；手工制品、古着、定制款这类确实没有 GTIN 的，填 <code>identifier_exists = no</code> 并至少提供 <code>brand</code> + <code>mpn</code>。</p>\n<p>GTIN 本身有校验位，映射时应当先验证再发送，而不是等平台报错。对 GTIN-13 的前 12 位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_1 \\dots d_{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> 为奇数</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> 为偶数</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\Big(10 - \\big(\\sum_{i=1}^{12} d_i \\cdot w_i \\bmod 10\\big)\\Big) \\bmod 10, \\quad w_i = \\begin{cases} 1 &amp; i \\text{ 为奇数} \\\\ 3 &amp; i \\text{ 为偶数} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为奇数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为偶数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>校验不通过说明源数据里 GTIN 被截断或抄错，此时应退回 <code>identifier_exists = no</code> 路线而不是发送一个坏 GTIN。</p>\n<p>变体是标识符的第二个维度：同一款衬衫的 M/L/XL 必须共享 <code>item_group_id</code> 但各有唯一 <code>id</code>，并额外提供 <code>size</code>、<code>color</code>、<code>gender</code>、<code>age_group</code> 供平台聚合，服装类目在多国对这些属性是<strong>强制</strong>的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>变体分组键</th>\n<th>单变体唯一键</th>\n<th>主标识符字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td><code>item_group_id</code></td>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td><code>gtin</code> / <code>mpn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td><code>item_group_id</code></td>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td><code>gtin</code> / <code>mpn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td><code>parent_sku</code></td>\n<td><code>seller_sku</code></td>\n<td><code>external_product_id</code> + <code>external_product_id_type</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok Shop</td>\n<td><code>product_id</code></td>\n<td><code>seller_sku</code> / <code>sku_id</code></td>\n<td><code>gtin</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Amazon 的差异最值得注意：它用 <code>external_product_id_type</code> 显式声明标识符类型（<code>UPC</code> / <code>EAN</code> / <code>ISBN</code> / <code>GTIN</code>），而不是像 Google 那样靠位数推断。映射规则里必须把「内部 GTIN 字段 + 地区」翻译成正确的类型枚举，否则北美 UPC-12 会被当成欧洲 EAN-13 拒收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多币种-单位与本地化字段\">多币种、单位与本地化字段</h2><p>价格字段的错误有三种：币种错、精度错、含税口径错。前两种是格式问题，第三种是业务问题。</p>\n<p>币种必须用 ISO 4217 三位代码。Google 的 <code>price</code> 币种由目标销售国推断，所以同一份 feed 推到不同国家必须拆成多个文件或走地区子 feed；Meta 则在字段里显式带币种。精度上，<code>19.90 USD</code> 是两位小数的十进制字符串，绝不能用二进制浮点拼接后发送——<code>0.1 + 0.2</code> 类误差会产出 <code>19.900000000000002</code> 这种被判格式非法的值。</p>\n<p>含税口径是最容易翻车的一处：跨境时同一件商品的展示价，在欧盟是含 VAT 价（如德国标准税率 19%、法国 20%），在美国是未税价（销售税在结账时按目的地计算）。映射规则必须把「目标国家 → 含税/未税口径 → 汇率版本」显式建模，不允许用「乘以一个固定系数」糊弄：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>price</mtext><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>price</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>fx</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{price}_{\\text{target}} = \\mathrm{round}_{2}\\Big(\\text{price}_{\\text{base}} \\times \\text{fx}(c_{\\text{base}} \\to c_{\\text{target}}) \\times (1 + \\tau_{\\text{vat}})\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0481em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fx</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{vat}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在美国为零、在欧盟为目标国标准税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">fx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 必须带版本号以便回溯——汇率一旦不可回溯，历史订单的展示价就永远对不上账。</p>\n<p>单位同理。重量在 <code>shipping_weight</code> 里必须带单位（<code>lb</code> / <code>kg</code> / <code>oz</code> / <code>g</code>），长度用 <code>in</code> / <code>cm</code>，换算用精确系数而非近似值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> lb</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.45359237</mn><mtext> kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ \\text{lb} = 0.45359237\\ \\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lb</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45359237</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> in</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2.54</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ \\text{in} = 2.54\\ \\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">in</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.54</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>（国际码定义，精确值），且四舍五入只在换算<strong>之后</strong>做一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"映射规则的可维护性-版本化与回归测试\">映射规则的可维护性：版本化与回归测试</h2><p>规则集一旦超过几百条，最大的风险不再是写错某一条，而是<strong>改坏已对的那一条且无人察觉</strong>。三项实践可防。</p>\n<p><strong>一是规则版本化。</strong> 每条规则带 <code>rule_version</code>，每次 feed 构建把所用版本写进产出元数据。这样「上周二的 feed 为什么 <code>availability</code> 是空的」可以精确复现，而不是靠猜；规则改坏的当天把 version 指回上一版即可恢复产出。</p>\n<p><strong>二是 golden file 回归测试。</strong> 维护一组覆盖典型场景的输入样本（有 GTIN / 无 GTIN、多币种、多变体、缺图、缺类目），对每个样本断言完整的输出字段映射快照。测试跑的是规则引擎的纯函数部分——输入 PIM 快照 + 规则版本，输出确定，不含时间与网络。没有确定性就没有可断言的快照。</p>\n<p><strong>三是 schema 漂移检测。</strong> 渠道规范会变。做法是把每个渠道的字段契约（字段名、类型、枚举、长度上限）落成机器可读的 schema 文件并纳入版本控制，定期核对 diff——渠道新增必填字段或调整枚举时，diff 会先于线上拒登出现。Amazon 的 Product Type Definitions API（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/product-type-definitions-api-v2020-09-01-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/product-type-definitions-api-v2020-09-01-reference</a> ）直接返回某个 <code>productType</code> 的 JSON Schema，是这一层最理想的自动化输入——不要手抄 Amazon 的必填属性清单，让它自己告诉你。</p>\n<p>最后是<strong>删除与重命名字段的迁移成本</strong>。feed 里的字段删除不是本地行为：渠道侧已索引的旧字段不会因为你停止发送就消失，通常要发一次显式清空才生效。所以规则表的删除项应先标记为 <code>deprecated</code> 并保留一个构建周期，再真正移除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>feed 工程必须把<strong>渠道规范、内部主数据、映射规则、序列化</strong>四层分开建模，因为它们各自的变更节奏差一个数量级。</li>\n<li>映射规则是 <code>(源路径, 变换原语, 目标字段, 参数)</code> 的四元组集合，执行顺序固定为规范化 → 映射 → 派生 → 校验，顺序可变就等于放弃回归测试。</li>\n<li>Google 的 Product Data Specification 是最常被参照的基线契约，但 <code>availability</code> 等枚举在各渠道写法不同（<code>in_stock</code> vs <code>in stock</code>），<code>value_map</code> 必须覆盖源枚举全集。</li>\n<li>标识符（<code>gtin</code> / <code>mpn</code> / <code>brand</code> + <code>identifier_exists</code>）决定商品能否被正确聚合；GTIN 发送前先验校验位，无 GTIN 时走 <code>identifier_exists = no</code> 分支；变体靠 <code>item_group_id</code>（Amazon 为 <code>parent_sku</code>）分组。</li>\n<li>价格必须用 ISO 4217 币种 + 十进制字符串，并按目标国正确处理含税口径与可回溯的汇率版本；单位换算用精确系数且只舍入一次。</li>\n<li>规则集靠版本化、golden file 回归、schema 漂移检测三项实践维持长期正确；字段删除要留一个构建周期的 <code>deprecated</code> 过渡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>字段填对只是起点。这些字段随后要经受渠道侧的合规检查（品类准入、政策禁售、图片规范），以及发送后在回执里逐行核对是否被接收——前者见<a href=\"../compliance-validation-quality/\">合规校验与质量</a>，后者见<a href=\"../ack-reconciliation-ops/\">回执对账与运维</a>。本章进度见<a href=\"./\">章节索引</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Feed Schema 建模与字段映射规则","id":"feed-schema-建模与字段映射规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：feed 契约的四层抽象","id":"核心概念-feed-契约的四层抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"Google Merchant Center：字段契约的基线","id":"google-merchant-center-字段契约的基线"},{"level":2,"text":"字段映射引擎：变换原语的表达","id":"字段映射引擎-变换原语的表达"},{"level":2,"text":"标识符策略：GTIN、MPN、brand 与变体分组","id":"标识符策略-gtin-mpn-brand-与变体分组"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种、单位与本地化字段","id":"多币种-单位与本地化字段"},{"level":2,"text":"映射规则的可维护性：版本化与回归测试","id":"映射规则的可维护性-版本化与回归测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"渠道接入开通、凭证授权与类目准入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/channel-onboarding-entitlement"},"next":{"title":"Feed 生成流水线、增量渲染与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/feed-build-transform/feed-generation-pipeline-scheduling"}}